<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include(`${partials}/head`, {
  noGlobalScripts: true,
  pageMeta: {
    title: 'Catnip Farms on Robinhood Chain | vfat.tools',
    description: 'Catnip Alley liquidity, MasterProwl NIP emissions, locks, and direct wallet actions on Robinhood Chain.',
    url: 'https://vfat.tools/robinhood/catnip/',
    image: 'https://vfat.tools/img/robinhood-catnip-social.png',
    imageAlt: 'Live Catnip farm table on vfat.tools using Robinhood Chain contract state.',
    imageWidth: 1200,
    imageHeight: 630
  }
}); -%>

<body>
<%- include(`${partials}/header_main`); -%>
<pre id="catnip-banner">
==================== =^.^= CATNIP · ROBINHOOD CHAIN ====================
SOURCE: Alley + MasterProwl + NIP locks
MODE  : Onchain RPC + direct wallet
=========================================================================
</pre>
<div id="catnip-loading" class="catnip-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span id="catnip-spinner" aria-hidden="true">[....]</span> <span id="catnip-loading-text">Reading Catnip contracts on Robinhood Chain…</span>
</div>
<div id="catnip-app" aria-live="polite"></div>
<%- include(`${partials}/disclaimer`); -%>
<style>
  #catnip-banner, #catnip-app, #catnip-app section { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  #catnip-banner, #catnip-app pre { overflow-wrap: anywhere; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .catnip-loading { padding: 10px 0; }
  .catnip-loading[hidden] { display: none; }
  .catnip-action { border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; }
  .catnip-action:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .45; text-decoration: none; }
  .catnip-field { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 4px 12px 4px 0; max-width: 100%; }
  .catnip-field input { box-sizing: border-box; font: inherit; min-width: 0; width: min(18ch, 42vw); }
  .catnip-table { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
  .catnip-row { border-top: 1px solid currentColor; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; min-width: 620px; padding: 8px 0; }
  .catnip-row pre { margin: 0; flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .catnip-note { max-width: 92ch; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .catnip-row { min-width: 0; display: block; }
    .catnip-row .catnip-action { margin-top: 5px; }
    .catnip-field { display: flex; margin-right: 0; }
    .catnip-field input { flex: 1 1 auto; width: auto; }
  }
</style>
<%- include(`${partials}/scripts_onchain`, {scriptname: 'robinhood_catnip'}); -%>
</body>
</html>
